text = text.replace(/[ \t]*Confirm the (?:engineer|arranger) with the requester, then present the summary again[^.\n]*\.?/gi, '')
           .replace(/[ \t]*Never add a surname they did not give\.?/gi, '')
           .replace(/\bDid the requester mean\b/g, 'Did you mean');
// 2. Asked "which studios are open?", she left out the M booths 3 of 3 times, though Room Availability listed them
